できない。例えば、C言語での次の表記があるとする。 [code]x * y ; [/code]これは、識別子 [code ]y[/code] を [code ]x[/code] へのポインタとして宣言しているとも解釈できるし、[code ]x[/code] と [code ]y[/code] の乗算の式とも解釈できる（後者の場合、式の値は捨てている）。2つの可能な解釈の一方を選択するため、コンパイラはシンボル...","thumb_url":"https://qsf.fs.quoracdn.net/-4-images.social_share_brand_logo.png-26-b6922c34f079ee95.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Quora","service_icon":"https://qsf.fs.quoracdn.net/-4-images.favicon.ico-26-ebf6a9e7f7b4576d.ico","thumb_width":1660,"thumb_height":1288,"from_url":"https://jp.quora.com/C-gengo-no-kansuu-pointa-ha-naze-bunpou-teki-ni-aimai-nanode-suka","original_url":"https://jp.quora.com/C-gengo-no-kansuu-pointa-ha-naze-bunpou-teki-ni-aimai-nanode-suka"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kAU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eaf501f3-78e0-46e1-a273-2d1efbaaa139","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Cだと本当にポインタとかけ算の区別が文法レベルで付かない問題あったらしいしな","ts":"1635759878.258600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGH65"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87a69424-9354-4f54-bd00-8aa808750f01","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"かけ算と混同するのは確かに一理ある","ts":"1635759873.258500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MW5RN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c25300d2-f47e-4ede-a062-244f2cecb713","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"一応こんな感じで言及されてはいるw","ts":"1635759857.257900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rQsq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee69ae1d-01a0-4124-85e4-7869aebd9ca2","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u0026gt; because that postfix * would conflate with multiplication. We could have used the Pascal ^, for example:","ts":"1635759842.257400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TfaG"}]},{"client_msg_id"